	"@id": "godot-xr-auto-hand",
	"@context": "tb",
	"data": "Godot XR Auto Hand (Godot-XR-AH)\n\nHand tracking that's automatically compatible with XRControllers. Turns hand gestures into button events.\nRepo: <https://github.com/Godot-Dojo/Godot-XR-AH>\nLicense: MIT\nStars: 28, 82 commits\nGodot version: 4.2+ (uses OpenXR hand tracking API)\nStatus: Active, tested on Quest 2 and Pico 4\n\nWhat It Provides\nAutomatic hand tracking compatible with XRControllers\nGesture → button mapping:\nPinch (index + thumb) = trigger button\nFist (middle + ring + little) = grip…",
